  next-command/auto-drive observation, replay fixture hashes, and expected
  terminal/suspension outcome. Raw artifacts are hashed only after canonicalizer
  normalization, and the canonicalizer version is part of the frozen record.
  Baseline amendment ledger entries are separate artifacts with dated
  justification, reviewer, old/new hashes, and affected rows.
- No manually authored conformance table can set row status.

